    "playing_style": "Conte's 2025/26 Napoli (2nd, 76 pts, 7 behind Inter) were an intense, physically demanding side alternating 4-3-3 and 3-5-2 with Rasmus Højlund (12 league goals) as focal point. Allegri, confirmed 3 July 2026 on a contract to 2029, historically prioritises defensive organisation, compactness and pragmatic control over pressing volume; expect fewer high-tempo phases and more emphasis on set pieces and transitions.",
